    heading: "rtmlogconfig",
    content: "Use the `RtmLogConfig` instance to configure and store local log files named `agora.log`. During the debugging phase, you can greatly improve efficiency by storing and tracking the running status of the app through logs. If you encounter complex problems and need Agora technical support to assist with the investigation, you need to provide the log information. `RtmLogConfig` contains the following properties:"
