    heading: "description-37",
    content: "When the lock is occupied, to ensure that your business is not affected, you may need to revoke the lock and give other users a chance to obtain it. Revoke the occupied lock by calling `revokeLock`. When the lock is revoked, all users in the channel receives the `RELEASED` type of the `onLockEvent` event. See Event Listeners."
